; Keep this list in sync with include/Astronomy/PCL/XisfCApi.h (C declarations)
; and Astronomy.PCL/Interop/NativeMethods.cs ([DllImport] wrappers). Adding a new
; export means touching all three files; missing the .def silently strips the
; symbol from the DLL even though the .h still declares it.
EXPORTS
    AstronomyXisf_Open
    AstronomyXisf_Close
    AstronomyXisf_NumberOfImages
    AstronomyXisf_SelectImage
    AstronomyXisf_GetImageInfo
    AstronomyXisf_ReadImageF32
    AstronomyXisf_GetLastErrorMessage
    AstronomyXisf_Add
